{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "62fa027655d1e06cb950ae0172b8ca5f9d9ddd440b132e4ae8a94e88ca96c397", "ja": "育、ブログ読んだよ。\n新しい曲、気に入ってくれたんだな。", "zh": "育，我看了你的博客。你喜欢上新歌了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "eb4a81da71912a2894ed5816bfb5334f84320a21aa40e7a7b6b91685fa68ea83", "ja": "え！？\nどうして、そんなに不満そうなんだ？", "zh": "咦！？\n为什么看起来这么不满？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "ba15c51ec5f2bdc6f75c59895a1ec6180e607fbafc98e5f02c0264c1604912f1", "ja": "新しい曲、おかあさんにも\n聞いてもらったんだけど……。", "zh": "新歌我也放给妈妈听了，\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee0c690f30b2b8eb42a3980a8cd7d3e5f57a0d4add56d8b64b1ea997341a8af4", "ja": "じこしゅちょうするところが、わたしとそっくりで、\nわたしが書いたみたいな歌詞だねって。", "zh": "自我主张的地方和我一模一样，简直就像是我写的歌词呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "be6946d7ea2791cc5085d3816816fca4892f7e498869a73dabbd33baea5e81fd", "ja": "わたしが、子どもだって言われてるみたい。\nなんだか、ふくざつ……。", "zh": "就像在说我是个小孩子一样。\n总觉得，心情好复杂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "08d391e29eb8ce05a64853b174bd2f60d61333f13e4096262fe9ce1e377dce82", "ja": "そうかな？　育の年頃らしさがあって、\n良い歌詞だと思うけどな……。", "zh": "是这样吗？我觉得很有育这个年纪的感觉，是很棒的歌词啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "00a8d0972c442e052809de35171b55206628196b1e9619b2fd580dbd764544b5", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}さん。\nわたし、今度はもっと、大人っぽい曲でもいいよ。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n我下次唱成熟一点的歌也可以哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "1cd4c643d1d00c394255580979eefb73f060ba8e83e012987f33ebf9a1f65daf", "ja": "このみさんみたいな歌とか、どうかな？", "zh": "像木实小姐那样的歌曲，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1c77740666c93d8d16776ee0ee89429ef07ca2dc57392fd5e6b9d6991ed95540", "ja": "このみさんみたいなっていうと、ラブソングか？\n育にはまだ早すぎるような……。", "zh": "要说像木实那样的歌，是情歌吗？\n对育来说，好像还太早了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "22bbd8d6f279a646aa380becbf70ce695059c481022e4b912a783e6761f9f274", "ja": "もう、早すぎじゃないよ！\nわたしだって、恋の歌くらい歌えるんだから。", "zh": "才不算早呢！我也能唱恋爱之歌的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "cd1744b09f4a5239080c3d05f94f54df6789a43d1c3cdd8f5fd123ba814c947b", "ja": "失敗しても、ちょうせんするほうがいいんでしょ？\nだから今度は、恋の歌にちょうせんさせてね！", "zh": "就算失败了，也要勇于尝试才对吧？\n所以下次，就让我挑战一下恋爱歌曲吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_064_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2b3ec9cf1a06a93dd00de66b71f25a60a1ff1e1165f6c8de700a856308e81941", "ja": "（育がますますおませさんになってしまった……。もう\n少し、子どものままでいてくれてもいいんだけどな！）", "zh": "（育变得越来越早熟了……再多当一会儿小孩子也没关系啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
